        "article_sha256": "9db2cf82ac69dfaeb774b150e20e372ad049b69bbb4f3a7bcc22b0a9bfc340c6",
        "body": "# Marketing AI for Small Business\n\nPractical steps for small business owners using AI.\n\n## Key facts\n\n### Focus\n\nStart with one repeatable workflow.\n\n### Measure\n\nTrack saved time and revenue impact.\n\n### Refine\n\nTighten the process before scaling.\n\n<nav aria-label=\"Table of contents\" data-cf-component-id=\"toc\" data-cf-component-type=\"toc\" data-cf-component-label=\"Table of contents\"><p><strong>In this article</strong></p><ol><li><a href=\"#intro\" data-cf-toc-target=\"intro\">Why this matters</a></li><li><a href=\"#workflow\" data-cf-toc-target=\"workflow\">Choose one workflow first</a></li></ol></nav>\n\n<a id=\"intro\"></a>\n## Why this matters\n\nAI can help small teams move faster without adding headcount.\n\nRelated reading:\n- [/resources](/resources)\n- [/events](/events)\n\n<a id=\"workflow\"></a>\n## Choose one workflow first\n\nPick one repetitive marketing task and document the baseline.\n\nRelated reading:\n- [/community](/community)\n\n## FAQ\n\n### Where should I start?\n\nStart with one low-risk workflow.\n\n## Next Step\n\n**Need help with AI workflows?**\n\nTalk to the MLAI team about practical next steps.\n\n[Learn more](/contact)",
